    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4160,
    "dDurationMs": 8320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billion dollars a day. Do you think the\naverage investor can beat the S\u0026P 500?",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8880,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So if you were to buy $250 into the S\u0026P\n500 every month from the age of 18, you",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14480,
    "dDurationMs": 6559,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have $1.4 million by the time you\nwere 60. But I believe if you follow the",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19199,
    "dDurationMs": 4401,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rules, you could probably beat the S\u0026P.\nDid you meet Jordan Belfford?",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22080,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Of course. He came down to the New York\nStock Exchange and he tried to recruit",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25359,
    "dDurationMs": 6401,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brokers to They were all taken off the\nfloor by the FBI in handcuffs.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30240,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Have you seen greed ruin a lot of\npeople's lives?",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32399,
    "dDurationMs": 5601,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Absolutely. I've seen them go broke over\nit. This is not a get-richquick scheme.",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36399,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not for people who just want to\nfind the easy way [music] out. That's",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39360,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not the way to do this. I got CO March\n15, 2020. Patient zero got the worst",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43280,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "strain that was out there. I was given 3\nmonths to live. I lost a big part of my",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46719,
    "dDurationMs": 3281,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "left lung.\n\u003e\u003e Peter, with the life and career that",
